<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Mid Term Exam Website</title>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- My Name -->
    <p>My name is [Your Full Name Here]</p>

    <!-- My Hobby Heading -->
    <h1>My Favourite Hobby is Reading Storybooks</h1>

    <!-- Why I like it paragraph -->
    <p>I really love reading storybooks because they take me to beautiful places in my imagination. Reading helps me to learn a lot of new English words, and it is a great way to enjoy myself before I go to bed at night.</p>

    <!-- Unordered List -->
    <h3>Things I need for reading:</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Interesting storybooks or comic books</li>
        <li>A quiet and comfortable place to sit</li>
        <li>A bright desk lamp or light so I can see clearly</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Image -->
    <h3>A picture of books:</h3>
    <img src="books.jpg" alt="A stack of storybooks" width="300">

    <!-- Video -->
    <h3>A video about reading stories:</h3>
    <video src="reading.mp4" controls width="300">
        Your browser cannot play this video.
    </video>

    <!-- The Form -->
    <h2>Please fill my form:</h2>
    <form>
        <!-- Visitor Name -->
        <p>
            <label>Enter your name:</label>
            <input type="text" name="name">
        </p>

        <!-- Visitor Email -->
        <p>
            <label>Enter your email:</label>
            <input type="email" name="email">
        </p>

        <!-- Checkbox -->
        <p>
            <label>Choose your favourite hobby:</label><br>
            <input type="checkbox" name="hobby" value="reading"> Reading books
        </p>

        <!-- Submit Button -->
        <p>
            <input type="submit" value="Click to Submit">
        </p>
    </form>

</body>
</html>